  <main id="main">
    <section class="page-hero section academy-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>
          <span class="i18n l-zh">AI 每日学堂</span>
          <span class="i18n l-en">AI Daily Academy</span>
          <span class="i18n l-es">Academia diaria de IA</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="subtitle">
          <span class="i18n l-zh">每天 10 分钟，构建你的 AI 核心知识体系。精选微课、练习与进度追踪，帮助你持续掌握 AI 核心能力。</span>
          <span class="i18n l-en">Ten minutes a day to build your AI core. Curated micro-lessons, practice tasks, and progress tracking to grow with the field.</span>
          <span class="i18n l-es">Diez minutos al día para construir tu núcleo de IA. Microlecciones seleccionadas, ejercicios y progreso para avanzar constantemente.</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section academy-signal">
      <div class="container neural-grid">
        <section class="signal-stack" data-panel="daily" id="daily-panel" aria-labelledby="daily-panel-title">
          <div class="signal-head">
            <div>
              <h2 id="daily-panel-title">
                <span class="i18n l-zh">微课精选</span>
                <span class="i18n l-en">Today's curated drops</span>
                <span class="i18n l-es">Selecciones del día</span>
              </h2>
            </div>
            <p class="signal-blurb" hidden></p>
          </div>
          <div class="signal-ticker" data-role="daily-status" aria-live="polite"></div>
          <div class="curriculum-shell">
            <div class="curriculum-toolbar">
              <div class="curriculum-toolbar__fields">
                <label class="toolbar-field">
                  <span class="i18n l-zh">关键词</span>
                  <span class="i18n l-en">Keywords</span>
                  <span class="i18n l-es">Palabras clave</span>
                  <input type="search" placeholder="模型、指标、标签" data-role="filter-search" data-i18n-placeholder="academy_filter_search_placeholder" />
                </label>
                <label class="toolbar-field">
                  <span class="i18n l-zh">难度</span>
                  <span class="i18n l-en">Difficulty</span>
                  <span class="i18n l-es">Dificultad</span>
                  <select data-role="filter-difficulty">
                    <option value="all" selected data-i18n="academy_filter_difficulty_all">全部难度</option>
                    <option value="beginner" data-i18n="academy_difficulty_beginner">入门</option>
                    <option value="intermediate" data-i18n="academy_difficulty_intermediate">进阶</option>
                    <option value="advanced" data-i18n="academy_difficulty_advanced">高阶</option>
                  </select>
                </label>
                <label class="toolbar-field">
                  <span class="i18n l-zh">主题</span>
                  <span class="i18n l-en">Topic</span>
                  <span class="i18n l-es">Tema</span>
                  <select data-role="filter-topic">
                    <option value="all" selected data-i18n="academy_filter_topic_all">全部标签</option>
                  </select>
                </label>
              </div>
              <div class="curriculum-toolbar__actions">
                <button class="curriculum-btn curriculum-btn--ghost" type="button" data-role="filter-reset">
                  <span class="i18n l-zh">重置筛选</span>
                  <span class="i18n l-en">Reset</span>
                  <span class="i18n l-es">Restablecer</span>
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <ol class="curriculum-list" data-role="daily-root">
              <li class="curriculum-item" aria-hidden="true">
                <button class="curriculum-head" type="button" aria-expanded="false">
                  <div class="curriculum-head__info">
                    <p class="curriculum-unit">第 1 单元 · 预计 45 分钟</p>
                    <h3>机器学习概论</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="curriculum-head__meta">
                    <span class="curriculum-pill">入门</span>
                    <span class="curriculum-pill curriculum-pill--ghost">音频 · 练习 · 引用</span>
                    <span class="curriculum-chevron" aria-hidden="true">
                      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                    </span>
                  </div>
                </button>
                <div class="curriculum-body" hidden>
                  <p class="curriculum-summary">我们正在点亮最新的课程信号，请稍候。加载完成后将展示摘要、练习、音频与引用。</p>
                  <div class="curriculum-metrics">
                    <div class="curriculum-metric">
                      <span>练习</span>
                      <strong>--</strong>
                    </div>
                    <div class="curriculum-metric">
                      <span>引用</span>
                      <strong>--</strong>
                    </div>
                    <div class="curriculum-metric">
                      <span>标签</span>
                      <strong>AI</strong>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="curriculum-actions">
                    <button class="academy-btn academy-btn--primary" type="button" disabled>开始学习</button>
                    <button class="academy-btn" type="button" disabled>开始答题</button>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </li>
            </ol>
            <div class="curriculum-foot" data-role="daily-pagination">
              <div class="signal-counter">
                <span class="i18n l-zh" data-role="daily-page-label-zh"></span>
                <span class="i18n l-en" data-role="daily-page-label-en"></span>
                <span class="i18n l-es" data-role="daily-page-label-es"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="orbit-buttons" role="group" aria-label="Lesson pagination">
                <button type="button" data-role="daily-prev" aria-label="上一页">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 18l-6-6 6-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                </button>
                <button type="button" data-role="daily-next" aria-label="下一页">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 6l6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
        <aside class="insight-rail" id="systems-panel"></aside>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container site-footer-center">
      <p>© <span id="year"></span> Fan Wan</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <div class="academy-modal" id="academy-modal">
    <div class="academy-modal__backdrop" role="presentation" data-role="modal-close"></div>
    <div class="academy-modal__panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="academy-modal-title">
      <div class="wealth-modal__head">
        <p id="academy-modal-title">
          <span class="i18n l-zh">详细内容</span>
          <span class="i18n l-en">Details</span>
          <span class="i18n l-es">Detalles</span>
        </p>
        <button type="button" class="wealth-modal__close" data-role="modal-close" aria-label="Close dialog">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6l-12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="wealth-modal__body" data-role="modal-body" aria-live="polite"></div>
      <div class="academy-modal__footer">
        <button type="button" class="academy-btn" data-role="modal-close">
          <span class="i18n l-zh">关闭</span>
          <span class="i18n l-en">Close</span>
          <span class="i18n l-es">Cerrar</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script type="module" src="/tools/academy/academy.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
